# Turborepo

- Put scripts on each relevant package `package.json`. Register the task in root `turbo.json`. Root `package.json` only delegates with `turbo run <task>`.
- Do not put build/test/lint logic only at the root when it can live in packages — that defeats parallelization and caching.
- Use `--filter` / `--affected` for targeted runs. Declare `dependsOn`, `outputs`, `inputs`, and `env` in `turbo.json`.
- Follow the installed `turborepo` skill for pipelines, cache, and package boundaries.
